    "description": {
      "content": "The Nomad HTTP API provides full programmatic access to a Nomad cluster. All routes use the /v1/ prefix. Endpoints support managing jobs, nodes, allocations, deployments, and evaluations across on-premises and cloud environments. Authentication uses an ACL token via the X-Nomad-Token header or Bearer authorization.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: HashiCorp",
